webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-annex-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"annex","sort_order":1,"sense":"吞併","alt_zh":"老師向高中生展示虛構古代帝國地圖模型，一塊鄰地被納入擴大的同色區域，無戰鬥。","example":"The history map showed how the empire sought to annex the neighboring territory.","example_zh":"歷史地圖顯示帝國如何企圖吞併鄰近領土。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/annex-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-annotation-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"annotation","sort_order":1,"sense":"註解","alt_zh":"高中女生在詩集頁邊添加簡短註記，老師在旁指導，文字不可辨識。","example":"Her annotation explained a difficult phrase in the poem.","example_zh":"她的註解說明詩裡一個難懂的片語。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/annotation-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-anonymity-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"anonymity","sort_order":1,"sense":"匿名","alt_zh":"高中生把無記名、不可讀的問卷投入封閉收集箱，老師保持適當距離。","example":"The survey protected the students' anonymity by collecting no names.","example_zh":"調查不收集姓名，以保護學生匿名身分。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/anonymity-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-antagonist-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"antagonist","sort_order":1,"sense":"對手","alt_zh":"高中舞臺劇中兩位衣著整齊角色分持不同花園模型方案、戲劇性爭辯，無暴力。","example":"The play's antagonist opposed the hero's plan to save the garden.","example_zh":"劇中的對手反對主角拯救花園的計畫。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/antagonist-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-antecedent-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"antecedent","sort_order":1,"sense":"先例；先行事物","alt_zh":"高中生在博物館比較老村莊花園模型與旁邊後來公共公園模型，單一展桌場景。","example":"The village garden w