 old family photographs in the attic.","example_zh":"他們在閣樓找到老家族照片。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/attic-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-attribution-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"attribution","sort_order":1,"sense":"歸因；作品歸屬","alt_zh":"成年策展人在畫廊研究未署名畫作、草圖與檔案，文字不可辨識。","example":"The curator questioned the painting's attribution to the famous artist.","example_zh":"策展人質疑這幅畫是否真出自那位知名藝術家。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/attribution-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-auditorium-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"auditorium","sort_order":1,"sense":"禮堂","alt_zh":"高中管弦樂團在寬敞學校禮堂舞臺練習，成年指揮專注帶領。","example":"The orchestra rehearsed in the school auditorium.","example_zh":"管弦樂團在學校禮堂排練。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/auditorium-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-automation-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"automation","sort_order":1,"sense":"自動化","alt_zh":"成年工程師向高中訪客展示有護欄的自動包裹輸送與分類設備。","example":"The factory used automation to sort packages by size.","example_zh":"工廠利用自動化依大小分類包裹。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/automation-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-backdrop-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"backdrop","sort_order":1,"sense":"背景幕","alt_zh":"高中劇團在舞臺整理大型森林繪畫布幕，成年老師指導。","example":"The painted forest formed the backdrop for the school play.","example_zh":"畫出的森林成為校園戲劇的背景幕。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/backdrop-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-bacteria-01-v1","level":"se